    "entityAnnotationsMap": "G7 (IMF): Canada, France, Germany, Italy, Japan, UK, US\nASEAN-5 (IMF): Indonesia, Malaysia, Philippines, Singapore, Thailand\nEuro area (IMF): EU countries that have adopted the euro as their currency\nAdvanced economies (IMF): i.e. US, Euro area, Japan, UK, Canada, Australia, among others"
